# D3-AD-006: A treatment train removes different kinds of contamination differently
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 60mL
add v1 SiO2 0.20g
add v1 PET 0.10g
add v1 methyl_orange 0.005g
add v1 NaCl 0.003mol
filter v1 v2
look v1
measure v2 uvvis
add v2 activated_charcoal 0.10g
filter v2 v3
measure v3 uvvis
measure v3 conductivity
particles v3
inspect
